  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo para el Establecimiento de un Sistema Integrado de Comercio Exterior</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Establishment of an Integrated Foreign Trade System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es apoyar el establecimiento de un sistema integrado de comercio exterior (SICEX) con el propsito de facilitar y promover el comercio exterior, potenciar el aprovechamiento de los acuerdos comerciales y la insercin de Chile en la economa internacional.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the project is to support the establishment of an Integrated Foreign Trade System (SICEX) in order to facilitate and promote foreign trade, make the most of trade agreements, and further integrate Chile into the world economy.</narrative>
  </description>
